 directly?",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,60.0,null,null,"Linear",0.5,null,null,null],["show","avg3_141","b","007",0.15,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_141","b",null,null,0.2,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["ctl","avg3_168","a",null,null,0.45,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["ctl","avg3_147","a",null,null,0.7,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","Master","Edda, I want to hear your decision.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_168","a","002","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_195","I... I want to go.==W== But isn't the City of a Thousand Monoliths really far...? Plus I'm basically broke...",0,""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_168","a",null,"vexation",null,null,null,1.0,"niunie1","OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_147","a","006","happy",null,null,null,null,"jushou2","Linear",0.5],["say","Council Member","Forget the cost. A gift like yours is rare... We'll fund everything. I'll even write the recommendation myself.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_147","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg3_141","b",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_168","a","024","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_195","...",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_112"],["ctl","avg3_168","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_141","b","007","attention",0.3,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg3_168","a",null,null,0.65,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","Master","Oh dear, crying before school even starts?",0,""],["w",0.5],["bg","mood_3",0,0.5],["ctl","avg3_168","a",null,"flurry",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_195","Because...! That means I have to leave you, Master...",0,""],["w",0.5],["bg","city_room_inside_daylight_winter",0,0.5],["ctl","avg3_168","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg3_141","b","003","happy",0.45,null,null,null,"jushou2","Linear",0.5],["say","Master","Hahaha! It's not like we'll never meet again. Just come visit during the holidays—this will always be your home!",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["trn",0,0,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","BG_Black",0,2.0],["w",2.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["say","0","Months later.",8,""],["w",0.5],["bg","wog_academy_classroom",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["show","avg3_178","a","003",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["se","se_021"],["ctl","avg3_178","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["w",1.0],["bgm","m12"],["se","se_022"],["ctl","avg3_178","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_178","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","0","==A-1==Dear Master, How have you been? It feels like ages since I left Norstheim.==P== ==A-1==I pretty much live in the library and the lab these days... But everyone here is so unique. I'm doing well and making plenty of friends.==P== ==A-1==I still miss home, though. The holidays are coming up, so I should be back to visit soon.==P== ==A-1==I'll stop here for now. I want to save the rest for when I see you. —Edda",10,""],["se","se_022_stop"],["w",0.5],["se","se_077"],["ctl","avg3_178","a","005",null,null,null,null,1.0,"jushou","Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_195","Now, just need to find a courier to send this out—",0,""],["se","se_060"],["stg",0,-60.0,null,null,"Linear",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_178","a",null,null,0.7,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",0.5],["bg","wog_academy_corridor",0,1.0],["w",1.5],["se","se_072"],["stg",0,-100.0,null,1.1,"Linear",1.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_120","c","011",0.7,0.1,0.9,0,null,0.0],["se","se_096"],["ctl","avg1_120","c",null,null,0.6,-0.35,1.5,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.3],["w",0.3],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.2],["w",0.2],["stg",0,0.0,150.0,null,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["se","se_053"],["tsk","Zhong"],["say","avg3_195","Wah?!",0,""],["ctl","avg1_120","c",null,null,0.5,-0.4,1.5,0.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["bg","wog_academy_corridor",0,0.5],["ctl","avg1_120","c",null,"flurry",0.5,-0.4,1.5,1.0,"chijing","Linear",0.3],["say","avg3_999","Sorry! You okay?!",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_059"],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5,null,null,"Xiao"],["say","avg3_195","Ouch...==W== Huh?! Senior Canace?",0,""],["w",1.0],["se","se_047"],["ctl","avg1_120","c",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["stg",0,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_120","c",null,null,0.3,0.0,1.0,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_178","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.3],["ctl","avg1_120","c","002","question",0.3,0.0,1.0,1.0,null,"Linear",0.3],["say","avg1_120","Hm? Aren't you Edda? From the Elite Class?",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_305"],["ctl","avg3_178","a",null,"flower",null,null,null,1.0,"jushou2","Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_195","Y-Yes! I'm Edda! I never expected to run into a graduate like you here...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_120","c","006","awkward",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_120","Well... It's complicated. I'm stuck here under observation for a while.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_120","c","004","attention",0.35,0.0,1.0,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["w",0.3],["say","avg1_120","Hm? Did you drop this?",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_077"],["ctl","avg1_120","c",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,"JuGong2","Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg3_178","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["obj","qstory_common_008",0,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_050"],["say","avg3_195","Oh, right, my letter! With the holidays coming up, I wanted to send a note home before I head back...",0,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_120","Aren't you from ... the Northern City?==W== If that's the case...",0,""],["w",1.0],["bgm",""],["se","se_055"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["objx"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_120","c","009",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["stg",0,null,-50.0,1.2,"OutSine",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_178","a",null,"question",0.6,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg3_195","Yes...? Why... Did something happen back in Norstheim?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_120","c","007","speechless",null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_120","Ah... Well, I've only heard rumors. But word is there was a massive catastrophe at the Norstheim Monolith...==W== They say it's gone dark.",0,""],["w",1.0],["se","se_483"],["ctl","avg1_120","c","005",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_112"],["ctl","avg3_178","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Xiao"],["w",1.0],["trn",0,0,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","wog_passage",0,2.0],["w",2.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["show","avg3_185","a","007",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_185","a",null,"attention",null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","Researcher","Hello. Are you the new researcher assigned to this unit?",0,""],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_195","b","008",0.3,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_195","b",null,null,0.35,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg3_185","a",null,null,0.65,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_195","Yes. I've been assigned to the Ancient Studies Department.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_077"],["ctl","avg3_185","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["say","Researcher","Understood, let me get you registered...==W== And place of birth?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_185","a",null,"question",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_195","b","013","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_195","Place of birth... Can I put N/A?==W== My home is already—",0,""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_195","b","013",null,null,null,null,1.0,"lengzhan2","OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.2],["w",0.2],["se","se_226"],["say","0","—wiped off the map.",8,""],["w",1.0],["bg","wog_office",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["obj","qstory_event_04_008",0,null,null],["w",1.0],["say","avg3_195","Master promised me that I would always have a home to return to... But since the Monolith had gone dark, I had nowhere left to go.",0,""],["se","se_021"],["say","avg3_195","I buried myself in work, day and night, trying to forget. Then I found the truth: Nocturn Eterna destroyed the Monolith. They destroyed my home.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_059"],["say","avg3_195","My people prided themselves on their strength. So why couldn't they stop Nocturn Eterna? For the longest time, I couldn't understand it...",0,""],["say","avg3_195","But now...==W== I see it clearly. It's simple, really.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_251"],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["say","avg3_195","Norstheim fell for one reason: they were weaker than Nocturn Eterna. That is the only truth.",0,""],["say","avg3_195","And if that's true...",0,""],["w",0.5],["objx"],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["tsk","Zhong"],["se","se_368"],["say","avg3_195","Then I need power, power so absolute no enemy dares challenge it... With that, I can protect everything.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_231"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",0,0],["bg","north_street_city_daylight",0,0.5],["w",1.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",1,0],["w",0.5],["bg","circle_light",0,1.0],["cbg",0,null,null,2.5,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm","m42"],["show","avg3_195","a","004",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_195","a",null,"happy",null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_195","So I used my rank in the Eye of Grace and accessed archives meant to remain forbidden.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_195","a","007","shy",null,null,null,null,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_195","I pieced the clues together... Until I found Them, buried deep in the ruins.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_195","a","015",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_195","With this power, history will never repeat itself—that one thought drove me to prepare for today.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_195","a","021","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_195","The final step of the plan... Even if every ritual before this failed, as long as Wraith killed me in the end—",0,""],["ctl","avg3_195","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_195","After all, the magic circle on me is my weapon. Destroying it still counts as \"disarming\" me... Which means the ritual could still...",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,0],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bgm",""],["say","0","My wish was supposed to come true...",8,""],["stg",0,-100.0,null,null,"Linear",0.5,null,null,null],["w",1.0],["bg","north_street_city_daylight",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_195","a","021",0.35,-0.35,1.4,0,null,0.0],["show","avg1_143","a","003",0.7,null,0.95,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_195","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.3],["se","se_100"],["ctl","avg1_143","a",null,null,0.7,null,null,1.0,"JuGong1","OutCubic",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_143","It is over.",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["ctl","avg3_195","a","010","speechless",null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_195","Why...==W== Why didn't you shoot?! Why!",0,""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_195","a","023","angry",null,null,null,null,"jushou2","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_143","The battle is done. There is no need for this.",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["ctl","avg3_195","a",null,"exclamation",null,0.0,0.95,null,null,"OutCubic",0.3],["say","avg3_195","Don't patronize me!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_195","a","022","happy",null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_195","I get it... You're soft. Just like the other warriors. They hesitated before Nocturn Eterna, too. That indecision is why...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a","016","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_143","You are wrong. You still don't understand.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_143","The strength of Norstheim never came from their weapons.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_143","a",null,"exclamation",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_143","They survived a harsh land by supporting one another. Their unity was their true power.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_251"],["ctl","avg3_195","a","013",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["w",1.0],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg3_195","a",null,null,0.45,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_195","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["se","se_073"],["w",0.1],["trn",0,0,true,false,0.2],["w",0.2],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["show","avg3_195","a","023",0.5,null,null,0,null,0.0],["show","avg1_143","a","003",0.65,null,null,0,null,0.0],["bg","north_street_city_daylight",0,0.5],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.2],["w",0.2],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["se","se_237"],["ctl","avg3_195","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,"jushou2","OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg3_195","Sentiments like that ... didn't save Norstheim! Did they?!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","025",null,null],["say","avg3_100","...!",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_195","a",null,null,0.4,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a","004",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_143","I understand your pain. But as I said... Northerners were strong because they stood together.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_195","a","008","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_195","So what?! What good did it do?!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_195","a",null,null,0.35,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["bgm",""],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg1_143","a","008",null,0.5,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg1_143","As long as one of us draws breath, the city lives on. Even if we have to rebuild from a single brick elsewhere...==W== That refusal to yield is Norstheim's soul.",0,""],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_143","a","009",null,0.5,-0.4,1.5,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.3],["fx",0,"fx_speedline_center",0,0],["goon"],["ctl","avg3_195","a",null,null,0.5,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_195","a",null,"speechless",null,null,null,1.0,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["w",1.5],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,1,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","city_room_inside_daylight_winter",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,2],["trn",1,1,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["show","avg3_141","b","003",0.5,-0.4,1.5,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_141","b",null,"happy",null,null,null,1.0,"jushou2","Linear",0.5],["say","Master","Hahaha! It's not like we'll never meet again. Just come visit during the holidays—this will always be your home!",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,1,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,2],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","north_street_city_daylight",0,0.0],["trn",1,1,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["se","se_112"],["show","avg3_195","a","019",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_195","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["w",1.5],["se","se_096"],["ctl","avg3_195","a","024",null,null,-0.05,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg3_195","Then what was it all for...?",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_062"],["stg",0,null,-30.0,1.05,"OutSine",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm","m20"],["mrt",1,"z","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Edda, stop torturing yourself.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_195","a","019",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_195","Tyrant...",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","012",null,null],["say","avg3_100","You've been blaming yourself this whole time, haven't you? Hating yourself for being too far away to stop the disaster.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","That's why you pushed yourself to the edge. Anything to numb the pain.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","010","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","But people back home cared about you. If they saw you destroying yourself over a tragedy you couldn't control... How do you think they'd feel?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_195","a","008","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_195","You think some sentimental speech is enough to stop me?",0,""],["ctl","avg3_195","a","021","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_195","Don't be naive. If you don't kill me here, I might just try to restart the ritual someday.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_074"],["show","avg1_143","a","004",0.65,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_195","a",null,null,0.3,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a",null,null,0.6,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_143","Suit yourself.",0,""],["se","se_078"],["ctl","avg1_143","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_143","I told you: pull whatever tricks you want. If you try anything, I'll just take you down again.",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["se","se_067"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_dust_heave",0,0],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Da"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg3_195","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],